cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "Envelope-spectrum slope and hydrodynamic entropy of long-duration music recordings"
message: "If you use this dataset or code, please cite it."
type: software
license: CC-BY-4.0
abstract: >-
  Code that measures the loudness-envelope spectrum of long music
  recordings and rebuilds the reported slope, hydrodynamic entropy,
  and three-panel figure. The measurements themselves are deposited
  separately on Zenodo.
